://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656580/extras/EpicBoss.png?t=1744268799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle epic bosses</strong> that will make your journey challenging and more fun. Each area houses multiple mini-bosses and a main boss. All bosses have out of the board abilities that allow them to manipulate the board in the favor of the enemies, providing an extra dimension of challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656580/extras/Boss.gif?t=1744268799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656580/extras/Traps_Obst.png?t=1744268799\" />Apart from facing the enemies on the board, you'll also have to keep an eye on off board weapons that maybe shooting arrows or flames in your direction. Making timing your movements a key part of your gameplay. Thus apart from knowing <strong>where</strong> to move you'll also be looking at <strong>when</strong> to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656580/extras/Obst.gif?t=1744268799\" /></p>","developers":["Dunali Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656580/cb5a7ac679ae7a70291b4b4dc8da162b7832e4c2/header.jpg?t=1744268799","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Dunali Games<br />\r\n\u00a9 2023 DMERCE TECH","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256977298,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256977298/movie480.mp4?t=1698212645","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256977298/movie_max.mp4?t=